     A*                                     15-17  FLTP: Type of Bill
     A*                                            1st digit = 1-9
     A*                                            2nd digit = 1-9
     A*                                            3rd digit = 1-9,A,B,C,D,P,I
     A*                                     18-19  FLTP: Discharge Hour
     A*                                     20     FLTP: Proc Code Method
