     A            E120A2    R               REFFLD(DS20) COLHDG('2 DESC 20')
     A*                              Pos. 1 = NM Gross Receipt Tax code:
     A*                                       S = Itemized Separately
     A*                                       I = Individual Chrgs incl NMGRT
     A*                                       X = N/A for this bill
     A*                              Pos. 2-6 NM Gross Receipt Tax Percentage
     A*                                       which will be translated to 5.2
     A*                              Pos. 7-9 Tx Hospital Type of Service:
     A*                                  Pos. 7-8 = Type of Service
     A*                                            IM = Acute Care Inpat Med
     A*                                            IS = Acute Care Inpat Sur
     A*                                            IR = Rehab Inpat
     A*                                            IP = Psych Inpat
     A*                                            HS = Hos Sur Outpat
     A*                                            AS = ASC Outpat
     A*                                            HO = Hos Outpat Other
     A*                                            AO = AS Outpat Other
     A*                                   Pos. 9 = I for Interim
     A*                                            F for Final
